{"parentUuid":"11b38063-feb3-4d7e-ba4c-41ef38a2e77b","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_01T9Wbg3rq1M2mQ85YJ7rF6B","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01LNCMAtNHYmJ1A17qy76nVB","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/soph/Work/entire/devenv/cli/redact/transcript/codex.go","content":"package transcript\n\nimport (\n\t\"bufio\"\n\t\"bytes\"\n\t\"encoding/json\"\n\t\"fmt\"\n\t\"strings\"\n)\n\nconst (\n\tcodexLineResponseItem = \"response_item\"\n\n\tcodexPayloadMessage              = \"message\"\n\tcodexPayloadFunctionCall         = \"function_call\"\n\tcodexPayloadFunctionCallOutput   = \"function_call_output\"\n\tcodexPayloadCustomToolCall       = \"custom_tool_call\"\n\tcodexPayloadCustomToolCallOutput = \"custom_tool_call_output\"\n\n\tcodexRoleUser      = \"user\"\n\tcodexRoleAssistant = \"assistant\"\n\n\tcodexBlockInputText  = \"input_text\"\n\tcodexBlockOutputText = \"output_text\"\n)\n\n// codexSystemPrefixes mirrors compact/codex.go's isCodexSystemContent. These\n// blocks are Codex-injected (permissions, AGENTS.md, environment_context, …)\n// and contain bounded structural metadata rather than user-authored content.\nvar codexSystemPrefixes = []string{\n\t\"<permissions\",\n\t\"<collaboration_mode>\",\n\t\"<skills_instructions>\",\n\t\"<environment_context>\",\n\t\"<turn_aborted>\",\n\t\"# AGENTS.md\",\n}\n\n// WalkCodex parses a Codex session JSONL transcript and emits each\n// content-bearing string to v. Structural fields (call_id, turn_id, model,\n// timestamps, encrypted_content, session_meta payload, event_msg metadata, …)\n// are never emitted.\n//\n// Schema reference (one JSON object per line):\n//\n//\t{\"type\":\"session_meta\", ...}                              → skipped\n//\t{\"type\":\"event_msg\",    \"payload\":{...}}                  → skipped\n//\t{\"type\":\"turn_context\", \"payload\":{...}}                  → skipped\n//\t{\"type\":\"response_item\",\"payload\"