to change. The wrinkle was a per-agent walker decision, not an API redesign.\n\n## State of the prototype\n\n- 4 library tests pass, both adapter compile-time interface checks pass, full `go build ./...` clean, full `mise run lint` clean (0 issues).\n- 2 of 6 supported agents now have walkers (claude-code + codex). Visitor abstraction validated against meaningfully different schemas: nested arrays vs nested-strings, role-positional vs role-typed, single content shape vs four payload types.\n\nFiles:\n- `redact/transcript/codex.go:1` — walker\n- `redact/transcript/codex_test.go:1` — content-only emission + secret-redaction tests\n- `cmd/entire/cli/agent/codex/walker.go:1` — adapter\n- `cmd/entire/cli/agent/codex/walker_test.go:1` — compile-time interface check\n\nNext natural step is either a third agent (Gemini or Copilot would be the next biggest schema differences) or wiring this into the actual redaction pipeline. Which way do you want to go?"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":248889,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":1019,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":248889,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":1019,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":248889,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":248889},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"}},"requestId":"req_011CawGccFFaBrbBCaZKEb8F","attributionSkill":"simplify","type":"assistant","uuid":"15c63195-8df6-496d-b8ab-bd1aa655c14a","timestamp":"2026-05-11T18:40:14.494Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/soph/Work/entire/devenv/cli","sessionId":"c277888e-b12d-4ae6-bfa7-0736750a0659","version":"2.1.129","gitBranch":"soph/improve-redaction"}
